<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">This prospectus contains information
and statistics relating to China&rsquo;s economy and the industries in which EZGO operates through the WFOE, the VIE and its subsidiaries
in China derived from various publications issued by market research companies and PRC governmental entities, which have not been independently
