</TR>
<TR STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top; text-align: justify">
<TD STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></TD><TD STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: left"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></TD><TD STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></TD></TR>
<TR STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top; text-align: justify">
<TD STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif"></TD><TD STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: left"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&#9679;</FONT></TD><TD STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">the
                                            date on which the right to exercise the debt warrants will commence and the date on which
                                            the right will expire;</FONT></TD>
</TR>
<TR STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top; text-align: justify">
<TD STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></TD><TD STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: left"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></TD><TD STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></TD></TR>
